  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><p>When you purchase through links on our site, we may earn an affiliate commission. <a href=\"https://www.kelsey.co.uk/cookie-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Here’s how it works</a></p><div> <main id=\"main\"> <!-- Post -->\n\t<article> <!-- Post Header --> <header> </header> <!-- Post Image --> <div> <!-- //Sponsor --> <!-- //Post Image --> <p><img width=\"900\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?w=900\" alt=\"GoPro HERO product photos\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg 2560w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?resize=300,200 300w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?resize=768,512 768w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?resize=1024,683 1024w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?resize=1536,1024 1536w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?resize=2048,1366 2048w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?resize=1240,827 1240w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?resize=900,600 900w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?resize=562,375 562w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/02/GoPro-HERO-2.jpg?resize=600,400 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></p>\t\t</div> <!-- Post Excerpt --> <!-- //Content -->\n\t<div>\n<p>While <strong>GoPro</strong> <a href=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/buying-advice/best-action-camera/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"196377\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">action cameras</a> are built to withstand shock, the brand itself is looking distinctly shaky right now. Latest reports[<a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/news/tradingview:da7e3b318bac5:0-gopro-secures-20m-insider-notes-tightens-revolver-terms-with-wells-fargo-amends-farallon-loan/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://www.tradingview.com/news/tradingview:da7e3b318bac5:0-gopro-secures-20m-insider-notes-tightens-revolver-terms-with-wells-fargo-amends-farallon-loan/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">1</a>] are that <strong>founder Nicholas Woodman is propping the company up by extending it a loan of his own money to the tune of $20 million</strong>, at an annual interest rate of 6.5%, while a buyer is desperately sought. It’s believed <strong>GoPro may not survive the year without a new owner or fresh injection of cash</strong>, with Woodman’s intervention acting as a stopgap rather than bail-out per se.</p> <p>This follows May’s announcement that <strong>the action camera specialist had experienced a sizeable 26% year-on-year revenue drop</strong> for the first quarter of 2026, with the amount of camera units sold (313,000) down 29%. That same month, the company put out a statement saying it had engaged a financial adviser to ‘review strategic alternatives’, a process founder and CEO Woodman says he strongly supports. While its announcement of a pro grade action camera trio – the <strong><a href=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/latest/photo-news/gopro-announces-three-new-action-cameras-one-of-them-a-mirrorless-with-micro-four-thirds-lens-mount/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/latest/photo-news/gopro-announces-three-new-action-cameras-one-of-them-a-mirrorless-with-micro-four-thirds-lens-mount/\">Mission 1, Pro and Pro ILS</a></strong> – was an ambitious step, such innovation may prove too little, too late.</p> <p>As additional background, <strong>GoPro has also recently been exploring business opportunities in aerospace and defence</strong>, two markets potentially worth $ billions. Don’t forget <strong>its cameras played a leading role in providing images from this year’s Artemis II NASA mission</strong>, too.</p> <p>However, simultaneously, GoPro has faced strong competition from rival <strong><a href=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/review/insta360-x5-review/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/review/insta360-x5-review/\">Insta360</a></strong>, against whom it recently lost a patent battle.</p> <p>Of course, <strong>any potential buyer would still inherit the issues and challenges that GoPro currently faces</strong> – which aren’t magically going away – as well as needing to pay the balance and interest on the company’s already mounting debts. Restructuring is already underway to cut 23% of its global staff by the end of 2026, but <strong>the latest manoeuvring suggests we may see a takeover before then</strong>.</p> <p><strong>Related reading:</strong></p> <ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/latest/opinion/is-gopros-mission-1-series-too-little-too-late-as-whispers-circulate-of-the-company-being-sold/\">Is GoPro’s Mission 1 series too little, too late, as whispers circulate of the company being sold?</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/buying-advice/best-action-camera/\">Best action camera to buy: the top models from GoPro, DJI, Insta360 and more</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/latest/photo-news/gopro-has-serious-doubts-about-its-ability-to-operate-as-a-business/\">GoPro has serious doubts about its ability to operate as a business</a></li>\n</ul> <p><em><strong><em><strong><em><strong><em><strong>Follow AP on&nbsp;</strong></em><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Amateur.photographer.magazine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em><strong>Facebook</strong></em></a><em><strong>,&nbsp;</strong></em><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ap_magazine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em><strong>Instagram</strong></em></a><em><strong>,&nbsp;</strong></em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AmateurPhotographerTV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em><strong>YouTube</strong></em></a><em><strong>,&nbsp;</strong></em><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@ap_magazine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em><strong>TikTok</strong></em></a>&nbsp;<em><strong>and&nbsp;</strong></em><a href=\"https://www.irysphotos.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em><strong>Irys</strong></em></a><em><strong>.&nbsp;</strong></em></strong></em></strong></em></strong></em></p> <!-- .c-header__icons-wrapper -->\n</div> <!-- Squirrel --> <!-- Review Details --> <!-- //Author --> <!-- Post image adverts added to Global content --> <a href=\"https://shop.kelsey.co.uk/amateur-photographer-magazine?offer=%20SUM25&amp;source=%20SUM25bs&amp;channel=brsite&amp;utm_source=brand&amp;utm_medium=brand-site-fixed_banners&amp;utm_campaign=amateur-SUM25\" target=\"_blank\"> <img width=\"970\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/AMPHOT_Web_ad_970x250px_APR25_FINAL.jpg\" alt=\"Amateur Photographer magazine subscription offer. 13 issues for only £2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/AMPHOT_Web_ad_970x250px_APR25_FINAL.jpg 970w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/AMPHOT_Web_ad_970x250px_APR25_FINAL.jpg?resize=300,77 300w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/AMPHOT_Web_ad_970x250px_APR25_FINAL.jpg?resize=768,198 768w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/AMPHOT_Web_ad_970x250px_APR25_FINAL.jpg?resize=900,232 900w, https://amateurphotographer.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/AMPHOT_Web_ad_970x250px_APR25_FINAL.jpg?resize=562,145 562w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\"> <img width=\"728\" height=\"90\